sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Merchant as Comerciante
    participant TN as Tiendanube
    participant App as App Backend
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Merchant->>TN: Desinstalar app
    TN->>TN: Revoca OAuth y script
    TN->>App: POST /webhooks/app/uninstalled
    App->>DB: uninstalled_at NOW
    TN->>App: POST /webhooks/store/redact
    App-->>TN: 200 received
